{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1363933-goblin-contracts","id":1363933,"title":"Goblin Contracts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-29T02:07:54-08:00","id":1363933,"title":"Goblin Contracts","content":"Been looking around a bit, and haven't seen that many custom made Goblin Contracts, and they're the more freeform version of contracts in 2E. <br /> <br /> What are your favourite / most used ones, oh mighty forum dwellers? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11842-aeryes","name":"Aeryes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11842_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-31T02:27:50-08:00","id":1364307,"title":"","content":"No love for goblins? XD<br /> Lemme start it off, see how y'all like it<br /> <br /> <b>I, Goblin</b><br /> The changeling bought a shard of confidence from a goblin and ate it.<br /> He can feel it poking near his liver and feels more secure when faced with threats to his Clarity.<br /> <b>Cost</b>: 1 Glamour<br /> <b>Dice Pool</b>: None<br /> <b>Action</b>: Reflexive<br /> <b>Effect</b>: The changeling may subtract 1 die from the Clarity Damage dice pool by invoking this contract.<br /> <b>Loophole</b>: The changeling has taken Clarity damage this scene or witnessed another take Clarity damage this scene<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Goblin Franchise</b><br /> The changeling bought a goblin franchise allowing him to deal in Goblin Debt.<br /> <b>Cost</b>: 2 Glamour<br /> <b>Dice Pool</b>: None<br /> <b>Action</b>: Instant<br /> <b>Effect</b>: The changeling may transfer 2 Goblin Debt to another willing supernatural creature. The recipient must be aware of potential consequences and agree to this.<br /> <b>Loophole</b>: The Goblin Debt is transferred to a non-changeling or a changeling who accepts it without payment.<br /> <br /> <br /> Both of these are in the spirit of goblins wanting their contracts to be convenient and used so as to acrue Goblin Debt. The Franchise in particular spreads their influence and also adds 1 Debt to the user.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11842,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11842-aeryes","user":"Aeryes","date":".  Adding Contract #2 01-31-2020, 04:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11842-aeryes","name":"Aeryes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11842_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}